sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER001 as PER-001 Customer
    participant APP as SVC-017 Digital Channels
    participant SVC001 as SVC-001 Retail Banking Core
    participant EVTBUS as SVC-102 Event Bus
    participant SVC013 as SVC-013 Fraud Detection
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053 Notification Service
    participant SVC111 as SVC-111 WORM Store
    participant PER054 as PER-054 Fraud Analyst

    Note over PER001,PER054: JRN-002 Context (prior to JRN-005 entry)

    SVC013-)SVC001: Publish FraudScoreCompleted (EVT-P03): fraud_score=0.96, fraud_risk_level=block
    SVC001->>SVC001: fraud_risk_level=block → PaymentIntent.status=fraud_blocked. Publish PaymentFraudBlocked (EVT-P08)
    SVC001-)APP: PaymentFraudBlocked event
    APP-->>PER001: Payment blocked for your security. No money has left your account.

    Note over PER001,PER054: JRN-005 begins — PH-064 Fraud Alert Trigger

    SVC013-)SVC013: Consume EVT-P08. Create FraudCase (trigger_type=realtime_block, total_loss_amount=0.00, status=open). Publish FraudCaseCreated (EVT-090)
    SVC013-)SVC053: Dispatch blocked payment notification + case reference to PER-001

    Note over PER001,PER054: PH-065 — Case Creation

    PER054->>SVC013: GET /fraud-cases/{id}
    Note over SVC013,EVTBUS: Cross-capability async: CAP-004 → CAP-001 via Event Bus (no direct sync calls)
    SVC013-)EVTBUS: Publish FraudDataRequested (payment_intent_id)
    EVTBUS-)SVC001: SVC-001 consumes FraudDataRequested — retrieves PaymentIntent for pattern analysis
    SVC001-)EVTBUS: Publish FraudDataProvided (£45,000, cop_result=no_match, fraud_score=0.96, fraud_risk_level=block)
    EVTBUS-)SVC013: SVC-013 consumes FraudDataProvided
    PER054->>SVC013: PATCH /fraud-cases/{id} (status=investigating). Publish FraudInvestigationStarted (EVT-091)

    Note over PER001,PER054: PH-066 — Investigation (pattern analysis)

    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/evidence (evidence_type=transaction_data — ML model features)
    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/evidence (evidence_type=device_data — consistent with customer profile)
    PER054->>SVC013: POST /fraud-cases/{id}/evidence (evidence_type=third_party_report — Cifas mule indicator on receiving sort code)

    Note over PER001,PER054: Analyst confirms: true positive block. No loss. No reimbursement required.

    PER054->>SVC013: PATCH /fraud-cases/{id} (status=closed, decision_rationale='True positive block confirmed')

    Note over PER001,PER054: PH-070 — Case Closure and ML Feedback Loop

    SVC013->>SVC013: Set closed_at. Publish FraudCaseClosed (EVT-097). Publish FraudPatternDetected (EVT-098)
    SVC013-)SVC013: Consume EVT-098. Reinforce mule sort code signal in ML model
    SVC013-)SVC111: Archive to WORM store (7-year retention)
    SVC013-)SVC053: Notify PER-001: case closed, payment remains blocked
